  "description": "A small, thin moan. The feel of skin against heated breath. Ragiha, a princess and a magician of great pedigree, took the controversial Wikkann, Zane, as her servant at the tender age of five, defying the disapproving stares of her court. She treated and cared for him like family. But one night, Ragiha dreams of doing unspeakable things with Zane. Relief washes over her when she wakes up, only to shatter when she realizes it wasn’t a dream at all. The man she once considered family has imprisoned her in a place of his own making. Ragiha must navigate her conflicting feelings for her friend-turned-lover while her fate—and that of her kingdom—hangs in the balance. \n\n(Source: Lezhin US)",
